meta {
  name: 03 Start trial
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/centers/me/trial
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
}

script:post-response {
  if (res.getStatus() === 201) {
    const body = res.getBody();
    if (body.codes && body.codes[0] && body.codes[0].code) {
      bru.setEnvVar("activationKey", body.codes[0].code);
    }
  }
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 201
  res.body.trialEndsAt: isDefined
  res.body.codes: isDefined
}

docs {
  Starts Pilote Exam Day (14-day free trial) and issues **three** activation codes.

  Run `Center Auth / 03 Login` first. Fresh center must be at TRIAL_PENDING
  (`01 Get subscription`).

  ## What this does

  - Sets `trial_started_at` / `trial_ends_at` (now + 14 days).
  - Sets seats to **3** and mints **three** codes with `expiresAt` = `trialEndsAt`.
  - Grants **6** manual Exam Day slots, **9** Mit Elena credits, **6** Schreiben IA credits (pools).
  - Captures `{{activationKey}}` = first code for `Student Activation / 01 Activate`.

  The clock starts **here**, on the manager button — not at first student
  activation. Re-read `01 Get subscription` after: `status` TRIAL,
  `studentsMayLearn` true.

  ## Checks

  - Second call → 409 TRIAL_ALREADY_USED
  - Center that already paid → 409 ALREADY_PAID
  - No Authorization → 401
  - Exam Day / entitlement purchase while on trial → 409 TRIAL_ADDONS_NOT_FOR_SALE

  Then: activate a student with the captured key, then
  `Subscription Access / 02 Learn`.
}
